is in 1894 in honor of the ideal of peaceful international contention for excellence.","wpu":"Olympia, Greece","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Ancient_Olympia%2C_Greece2.jpg/960px-Ancient_Olympia%2C_Greece2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},"wk":"2026-10-18"}